{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "spanish", "appid": 548430, "month": "2023-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1672531200, "end_date": 1673222399, "month_true_total": 124, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:09:08 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "130465420", "author": {"steamid": "76561199140431465", "personaname": "Dani", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199140431465/", "num_games_owned": 121, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 1414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 620, "last_played": 1708980811, "avatar": "6e92cacba506db5f8d777c6a0d5ebf6040b979e0"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "muy buen juego", "timestamp_created": 1673217357, "timestamp_updated": 1673217357, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130462242", "author": {"steamid": "76561198874489649", "personaname": "Brother Daniel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198874489649/", "num_games_owned": 88, "num_reviews": 42, "playtime_forever": 74490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4022, "last_played": 1781794546, "avatar": "873db93c1910ebc6ab728b7c794651f37a5e8abc"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Tras jugar casi 400h me he dado cuenta de que es uno de los mejores juegos que he probado en años por no decir en mi vida,\nes multijugador, no se hace para nada repetitivo, tiene montones de variaciones de enemigos y los que están por venir, nunca verás 2 cuevas iguales, tiene 7 tipos de misiones, cada una de las misiones pueden tener alteraciones como perdida del escudo, admósfera rica, bichos dorados, bichos explosivos, fiebre del oro, ademas con la posibilidad de encontrar una maquina que te permite conseguir mejoras para tus armas o atuendos y encontrar restos de algún minero muerto que te dará atuendos, skin para arma, piezas para el pico y colores, todo ello aleatoriamente de pases de temporada pasados\nAdemás los pases de temporada (son gratis pillate el juego) siempre traen cosas nuevas al juego cada 6 meses, ya sea enemigos, misiones e incluso biomas que por cierto a mitad del mes que viene 15 de junio meterán el bioma corrupción del Rockbid con nuevos enemigos muy interesantes, luego te darás cuenta de lo buena que es la comunidad y de los detalles de este magnifico juego que te hará sacar una sonrisa (yo solo digo que los creadores del juego se lo toman con humor).... aah si casi se me olvida los mas importante.. puedes beber cerveza con tus amigos mineros", "timestamp_created": 1673213732, "timestamp_updated": 1684434934, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130397105", "author": {"steamid": "76561198185330974", "personaname": "Mariin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198185330974/", "num_games_owned": 37, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 8647, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4304, "last_played": 1783340375, "avatar": "62290681848b99e427f0a1ab984cfbe7f88ecf91"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Falta parametros de lanzamiento, puede llegar a presentar problemas para jugar", "timestamp_created": 1673144727, "timestamp_updated": 1673144727, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471869319677352905", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130375562", "author": {"steamid": "76561198865013320", "personaname": "Chori31_", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198865013320/", "num_games_owned": 195, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 3961, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2198, "last_played": 1757872820, "avatar": "b26b9b4a76c4c700b4de72cd03797ad8849f79b2"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "Deep rock es un increíble juego co-op para jugar con amigos desde Steam o Xbox!\nRealmente es un juego interesante por la variedad de misiones y variables que tiene, lo único malo es que te puedes cansar rápido si juegas muy seguido ya que las misiones son las mismas con cambios en el terreno.", "timestamp_created": 1673121685, "timestamp_updated": 1673121685, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.563492059707641602", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "130325793", "author": {"steamid": "76561199207650287", "personaname": "gErArD", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199207650287/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 31370, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 998, "last_played": 1781053487, "avatar": "aa0bfd1cd8ad030bbd849e79f756914d80373379"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "ROCK AND STONEEEEEEEEEEE", "timestamp_created": 1673071297, "timestamp_updated": 1673071297, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, 